{"page":348,"verses":[{"verse_key":"23:90","surah":23,"ayah":90,"ar_uthmani":"بَلْ أَتَيْنَـٰهُم بِٱلْحَقِّ وَإِنَّهُمْ لَكَـٰذِبُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The fact is, We brought them the truth and they are lying.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"بَلْ","en_gloss":"Nay","transliteration":"bal","verse_key":"23:90"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَتَيْنَـٰهُم","en_gloss":"We (have) brought them","transliteration":"ataynāhum","verse_key":"23:90"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِٱلْحَقِّ","en_gloss":"the truth","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","verse_key":"23:90"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَإِنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"but indeed, they","transliteration":"wa-innahum","verse_key":"23:90"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَكَـٰذِبُونَ","en_gloss":"surely, (are) liars","transliteration":"lakādhibūna","verse_key":"23:90"},{"pos":6,"ar":"٩٠","en_gloss":"(90)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"23:90"}]},{"verse_key":"23:91","surah":23,"ayah":91,"ar_uthmani":"مَا ٱتَّخَذَ ٱللَّهُ مِن وَلَدٍ وَمَا كَانَ مَعَهُۥ مِنْ إِلَـٰهٍ ۚ إِذًا لَّذَهَبَ كُلُّ إِلَـٰهٍۭ بِمَا خَلَقَ وَلَعَلَا بَعْضُهُمْ عَلَىٰ بَعْضٍ ۚ سُبْحَـٰنَ ٱللَّهِ عَمَّا يَصِفُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God has never had a child. Nor is there any god beside Him- if there were, each god would have taken his creation aside and tried to overcome the others. May God be exalted above what they describe!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"23:91"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱتَّخَذَ","en_gloss":"Allah has taken","transliteration":"ittakhadha","verse_key":"23:91"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah has taken","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"23:91"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"23:91"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَلَدٍۢ","en_gloss":"son","transliteration":"waladin","verse_key":"23:91"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"23:91"},{"pos":7,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"is","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"23:91"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَعَهُۥ","en_gloss":"with Him",